    "forkStatus": "modified-unendorsed",
    "description": "This is a modified downstream fork. It retains two build/type-only adaptations and adds explicit behavioral changes for a validated Version 3 host checkpoint at the post-decode READ boundary, a finite per-turn instruction budget, enforcement of the story's parse-buffer token capacity, and checkpointable Z-machine RANDOM semantics with deterministic reseeding and unbiased tail-rejection sampling.",
    "runtimeCompatibilityId": "dork-e5fce5ca678660611b5d2daa94bbffdb3a84e622-fork-a0a31ec97a78771229615c4311ea4209813e29a65df421f0e020b161447f1605",
